+Stream B, master context §§2,5,6,9; one writer. Scope was the separate [test Sheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/13WC54eKp6kLnE05XCey38q7aZHYrnrs6bpBQP5J3QtM/edit) and [bound test Apps Script](https://script.google.com/u/0/home/projects/1ILKjMLjbVErqsUMbz0-Cx0FbifI0R0aPpt5mDlNKmG0hfDdk3F-Y5BWd/edit) only. Change `P1-20260929-10`; synthetic Add Request `add-1790643489683-6r7d6ujyhrs`. Before: fresh isolated Sheet read showed GGB 12 and MAG 10 items, 50 journal events, GGB row 15 empty. Test Code.gs LF SHA256 was `D1D4DEE32188B35807DD8B3C5A0F6DEAEE7EF14C4C8A1B14769E4844E0A090AD`.
